OL,3,GNEWSALaxey Wheel's 1980s ticket office
OL,4,Ato be demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor more than 170 years, the Great
OL,7,FLaxey Wheel has stood above the village
OL,8,Fthat once depended on it, a giant red
OL,9,Fwaterwheel built to drain one of the
OL,10,FIsle of Man's busiest mines.
OL,12,FNow work is under way to preserve and
OL,13,Fimprove the attraction for future
OL,14,Fvisitors.
OL,16,FAs part of the latest phase, the
OL,17,Fcylindrical ticket office, which has
OL,18,Fwelcomed more than a million visitors
OL,19,Fsince it was built in the 1980s, will
OL,20,Fbe removed and the information displays
OL,21,Facross the site will be refreshed over
OL,22,Fthe winter.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
