OL,3,GNEWSALaxey Wheel's 1980s ticket office
OL,4,Ato be demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FManx National Heritage said the work
OL,7,Fwould help ensure that this "remarkable
OL,8,Fheritage is preserved and celebrated
OL,9,Ffor generations to come".
